1
00:00:07,625 --> 00:00:09,025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:36,345 --> 00:01:39,025
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WEB NOVEL
<i>THE EARLY SPRING</i>, BY GU NIANG BIE KU

3
00:01:42,905 --> 00:01:43,945
Where were you?

4
00:01:45,625 --> 00:01:46,705
I went to make a call.

5
00:01:47,665 --> 00:01:48,985
Sun Yu.

6
00:01:49,665 --> 00:01:50,705
Wake up.

7
00:01:51,505 --> 00:01:52,505
One more round!

8
00:01:53,225 --> 00:01:54,345
One more?

9
00:01:58,225 --> 00:01:59,065
Where's Yao Bei?

10
00:01:59,145 --> 00:02:01,025
She said she wanted to head back
to pack her luggage.

11
00:02:01,105 --> 00:02:02,025
Then, she left.

12
00:02:03,385 --> 00:02:04,305
Right.

13
00:02:05,145 --> 00:02:06,345
She got promoted.

14
00:02:06,425 --> 00:02:08,225
She's going to Hong Kong, China.

15
00:02:08,825 --> 00:02:09,985
-Promoted?
-She's leaving Beijing.

16
00:02:11,385 --> 00:02:13,705
I almost forgot to tell you this.

17
00:02:13,785 --> 00:02:14,785
I got promoted too.

18
00:02:16,065 --> 00:02:18,145
Don't tell me you're leaving Beijing too.

19
00:02:18,225 --> 00:02:19,465
No.

20
00:02:19,545 --> 00:02:20,705
No way.

21
00:02:20,785 --> 00:02:22,745
I'm not leaving until I get
a three-bedroom, one-living-room flat

22
00:02:22,825 --> 00:02:23,705
in Beijing.

23
00:02:24,305 --> 00:02:25,905
Don't leave.

24
00:02:25,985 --> 00:02:28,465
-No.
-None of you can leave Beijing.

25
00:02:28,545 --> 00:02:30,785
If you leave, no one will keep me company.

26
00:02:30,865 --> 00:02:32,225
Don't worry.

27
00:02:32,305 --> 00:02:34,505
I won't leave. I'll grow old with you.

28
00:02:34,585 --> 00:02:36,545
Pinky promise. None of you can leave.

29
00:02:36,625 --> 00:02:41,225
We'll stay in Beijing
and make our dreams come true.

30
00:02:42,745 --> 00:02:44,945
Make our dreams come true together.

31
00:02:46,505 --> 00:02:47,465
Don't go.

32
00:02:48,745 --> 00:02:49,785
Yes.

33
00:02:50,745 --> 00:02:51,905
Already passing out?

34
00:02:52,425 --> 00:02:53,985
Come on. You guys are boring.

35
00:02:54,065 --> 00:02:56,705
I'm just getting started,
and you guys are out cold.

36
00:02:57,745 --> 00:02:58,945
Lumi.

37
00:02:59,665 --> 00:03:00,945
Do you have a boyfriend?

38
00:03:01,745 --> 00:03:03,105
So many of them.

39
00:03:03,185 --> 00:03:05,145
I'm sure you can have more.

40
00:03:05,225 --> 00:03:06,625
We have a blind date event tomorrow.

41
00:03:06,705 --> 00:03:07,545
Come check it out.

42
00:03:07,625 --> 00:03:09,145
You can get any guy you want.

43
00:03:09,865 --> 00:03:11,185
I want one who looks like Eddie Peng.

44
00:03:11,265 --> 00:03:13,625
Eddie Peng?

45
00:03:13,705 --> 00:03:15,505
You might have encountered
a pig-butchering scam.

46
00:03:15,585 --> 00:03:16,825
You don't have a guy like that?

47
00:03:18,025 --> 00:03:20,065
Why bother mentioning it then?

48
00:03:20,985 --> 00:03:23,545
BEING WITH YOU IS LIKE A LEAP OF FAITH

49
00:03:28,385 --> 00:03:29,305
Morning.

50
00:03:29,385 --> 00:03:30,625
Morning, Tao.

51
00:03:30,705 --> 00:03:31,545
Morning.

52
00:03:32,545 --> 00:03:34,025
You're so early today.

53
00:03:35,625 --> 00:03:36,905
-Morning.
-Morning, Lumi.

54
00:03:40,865 --> 00:03:42,705
You're back in full force.

55
00:03:42,785 --> 00:03:44,345
You even put on red lipstick.

56
00:03:44,425 --> 00:03:45,625
We partied until so late last night,

57
00:03:45,705 --> 00:03:48,145
I almost couldn't wake up this morning.

58
00:03:49,465 --> 00:03:52,025
I agreed to be there for Sun Yu's event,

59
00:03:52,105 --> 00:03:53,385
so I dressed up a bit.

60
00:03:54,665 --> 00:03:56,665
Oh, the girl with the red sweater?
The matchmaker?

61
00:03:56,745 --> 00:03:57,585
Yes.

62
00:03:58,705 --> 00:04:00,425
Don't go to her matchmaking event.

63
00:04:00,505 --> 00:04:02,265
Why not meet up
with my childhood friend first?

64
00:04:03,425 --> 00:04:05,825
I'm just there to show support,
not for the blind date.

65
00:04:05,905 --> 00:04:07,785
When you're there this evening,

66
00:04:07,865 --> 00:04:08,945
check out the guys for me.

67
00:04:09,025 --> 00:04:11,585
See if there's someone like Eddie Peng,

68
00:04:12,185 --> 00:04:13,505
like what your friend said.

69
00:04:13,585 --> 00:04:15,625
If you find one, keep him for me.

70
00:04:15,705 --> 00:04:16,545
Sure.

71
00:04:18,624 --> 00:04:20,064
-Morning, Mr. Luan.
-Boss.

72
00:04:27,825 --> 00:04:29,025
Morning, Luke.

73
00:04:31,625 --> 00:04:32,745
Luan Nian.

74
00:04:33,265 --> 00:04:34,785
I want to hold onto you.

75
00:04:59,385 --> 00:05:01,025
LUKE: LUMI, COME TO MY OFFICE

76
00:05:04,105 --> 00:05:05,145
Come in.

77
00:05:06,865 --> 00:05:08,825
Boss. How can I help?

78
00:05:08,905 --> 00:05:11,665
How is the progress of the proposal
that you and Shang Zhitao are working on?

79
00:05:11,745 --> 00:05:12,865
I told her to submit it tomorrow.

80
00:05:12,945 --> 00:05:13,825
She has a blind date today.

81
00:05:14,985 --> 00:05:16,025
A blind date?

82
00:05:16,105 --> 00:05:19,185
Yes. She can't work overtime
every day, can she?

83
00:05:20,065 --> 00:05:23,185
We must all live our lives. Right, boss?

84
00:05:25,865 --> 00:05:27,105
Do you know why you work overtime?

85
00:05:27,785 --> 00:05:29,585
Because you don't focus on work
during office hours.

86
00:05:29,665 --> 00:05:31,145
I need the proposal today.

87
00:05:55,945 --> 00:05:57,105
Luke.

88
00:05:58,585 --> 00:05:59,505
Come with me.

89
00:06:01,185 --> 00:06:02,145
My work is done.

90
00:06:02,225 --> 00:06:03,305
Overtime.

91
00:06:04,385 --> 00:06:05,425
You want the proposal?

92
00:06:05,505 --> 00:06:06,865
I already sent it to Lumi.

93
00:06:06,945 --> 00:06:09,305
There is something else. Come.

94
00:06:26,305 --> 00:06:28,625
The seat belt is stuck.

95
00:06:54,905 --> 00:06:55,905
Thank you.

96
00:06:56,465 --> 00:06:57,625
Have you gotten the driving license?

97
00:06:59,065 --> 00:07:00,385
I got it last month.

98
00:07:02,785 --> 00:07:03,625
I'll take you to practice driving.

99
00:07:09,305 --> 00:07:10,945
You will participate in Yueteng's
new car test drive event.

100
00:07:13,825 --> 00:07:16,745
So by working overtime,
you mean I need to practice my driving?

101
00:07:17,345 --> 00:07:19,345
I mean I'm working overtime
to practice with you.

102
00:07:28,385 --> 00:07:30,105
<i>Sorry, I can't be there.</i>

103
00:07:30,185 --> 00:07:31,945
<i>Emergency overtime.</i>

104
00:07:56,265 --> 00:07:58,425
Take the wheel. I'll sit next to you.

105
00:07:59,585 --> 00:08:00,705
Practice with your car?

106
00:08:00,785 --> 00:08:02,065
Don't you have a driving license?

107
00:08:23,265 --> 00:08:24,465
Pull your seat forward.

108
00:08:34,865 --> 00:08:35,705
Practice.

109
00:08:45,705 --> 00:08:46,545
Go now.

110
00:08:57,225 --> 00:08:58,305
You were so eager to leave work today.

111
00:08:58,385 --> 00:08:59,905
Who were you planning to see?

112
00:09:02,385 --> 00:09:03,385
My flatmate.

113
00:09:03,465 --> 00:09:04,905
You have a blind date with your flatmate?

114
00:09:19,345 --> 00:09:21,025
Just how did you get your driving license?

115
00:09:22,345 --> 00:09:23,825
Let me go out and check.

116
00:09:23,905 --> 00:09:24,785
No need.

117
00:09:25,505 --> 00:09:26,865
I'll drive.

118
00:09:49,345 --> 00:09:50,465
Sorry.

119
00:09:52,945 --> 00:09:54,305
You haven't answered me.

120
00:09:54,985 --> 00:09:56,225
Who do you have a blind date with?

121
00:10:02,025 --> 00:10:02,865
Are…

122
00:10:04,305 --> 00:10:05,745
Are you jealous?

123
00:10:08,505 --> 00:10:09,585
You wish.

124
00:10:13,985 --> 00:10:15,225
My flatmate

125
00:10:15,745 --> 00:10:18,065
works in the marketing division
of a dating website.

126
00:10:18,865 --> 00:10:20,265
So I--

127
00:12:16,225 --> 00:12:17,585
<i>It was an accident.</i>

128
00:12:18,105 --> 00:12:19,785
<i>You had an accident, I know.</i>

129
00:12:19,865 --> 00:12:21,145
<i>But what about Luan Nian?</i>

130
00:12:21,225 --> 00:12:22,625
<i>Was he also an accident?</i>

131
00:12:23,545 --> 00:12:25,505
<i>First, he saved you,</i>

132
00:12:25,585 --> 00:12:27,265
<i>then, he created the happy accident.</i>

133
00:12:30,065 --> 00:12:34,145
The way I see it,
he has been playing the long game.

134
00:12:35,225 --> 00:12:36,705
<i>Date a few people.</i>

135
00:12:36,785 --> 00:12:38,345
Experiment a bit while you're young.

136
00:12:42,065 --> 00:12:44,345
<i>We only live for around 30,000 days.</i>

137
00:12:44,425 --> 00:12:45,705
<i>If you like someone, tell them.</i>

138
00:12:45,785 --> 00:12:47,305
<i>If you miss them, go see them.</i>

139
00:12:47,825 --> 00:12:49,465
As long as we're safe
and it's what we want,

140
00:12:49,545 --> 00:12:50,785
we have nothing to lose.

141
00:13:29,825 --> 00:13:30,905
If you want,

142
00:13:31,505 --> 00:13:33,545
we can keep our relationship private.

143
00:13:46,065 --> 00:13:46,905
You…

144
00:13:47,505 --> 00:13:49,225
You don't wear pajamas?

145
00:13:49,945 --> 00:13:50,985
You're wearing mine.

146
00:13:55,945 --> 00:13:57,385
I'll return them to you later.

147
00:13:58,265 --> 00:13:59,465
I want them now.

148
00:14:08,865 --> 00:14:10,145
I have to go home.

149
00:14:10,225 --> 00:14:11,625
I have work tomorrow.

150
00:14:17,425 --> 00:14:18,305
Sure.

151
00:14:19,505 --> 00:14:21,905
Let me call Mr. Liu. He'll drive you home.

152
00:14:21,985 --> 00:14:24,305
-Don't.
-Mr. Liu.

153
00:14:24,385 --> 00:14:26,465
Sorry for calling you this late.

154
00:14:26,545 --> 00:14:27,945
Can you send someone home for me?

155
00:14:28,665 --> 00:14:30,185
Yes, she's at my home.

156
00:14:40,425 --> 00:14:41,265
What?

157
00:14:46,505 --> 00:14:48,225
I don't want him to drive me back.

158
00:14:48,905 --> 00:14:50,185
He'll recognize me.

159
00:14:52,985 --> 00:14:54,345
So, what do you want?

160
00:14:57,705 --> 00:14:59,105
I'll sleep in the guest room.

161
00:15:01,505 --> 00:15:03,265
Planning to disappear tomorrow
without saying goodbye

162
00:15:03,865 --> 00:15:04,985
and just leave me a small note?

163
00:15:08,705 --> 00:15:10,425
I won't leave you a note this time.

164
00:15:12,505 --> 00:15:13,945
Last time, it was an accident.

165
00:15:15,505 --> 00:15:16,865
But this time, it's not.

166
00:15:19,745 --> 00:15:21,065
What is it then?

167
00:15:25,265 --> 00:15:26,465
I don't want to lose my job.

168
00:15:27,745 --> 00:15:29,425
I don't want to jeopardize my job either.

169
00:15:30,745 --> 00:15:32,905
I don't want others to think
I'm taking shortcuts

170
00:15:33,665 --> 00:15:34,505
by relying on you.

171
00:15:49,825 --> 00:15:51,265
I'll sleep in the guest room.

172
00:16:49,665 --> 00:16:51,025
You're making it more obvious.

173
00:16:52,585 --> 00:16:53,545
Can you

174
00:16:55,705 --> 00:16:57,465
drop me off at the subway?

175
00:16:59,825 --> 00:17:00,745
Eat first.

176
00:17:14,464 --> 00:17:16,704
You made this yourself?

177
00:17:16,785 --> 00:17:17,985
It's delicious.

178
00:17:40,545 --> 00:17:42,145
Can I have one more glass?

179
00:17:42,745 --> 00:17:43,705
Yes.

180
00:17:43,785 --> 00:17:44,745
Thank you.

181
00:18:25,985 --> 00:18:28,425
Just drop me off
at the subway entrance in front.

182
00:18:30,185 --> 00:18:32,385
JINTAI XIZHAO SUBWAY STATION

183
00:18:36,025 --> 00:18:36,865
We missed it.

184
00:18:38,025 --> 00:18:39,745
It's pouring. No need for the hassle.

185
00:18:53,825 --> 00:18:55,305
No one's around at this time.

186
00:18:55,825 --> 00:18:56,705
Just go up first.

187
00:19:27,905 --> 00:19:30,785
SHANG ZHITAO

188
00:19:33,625 --> 00:19:35,105
<i>Floor One.</i>

189
00:19:35,625 --> 00:19:37,385
Coming up from the parking lot?

190
00:19:37,465 --> 00:19:38,665
Did you buy a car?

191
00:19:38,745 --> 00:19:39,745
No.

192
00:19:39,825 --> 00:19:41,425
Sun Yu gave me a ride.

193
00:19:44,105 --> 00:19:46,185
Your friend is so much better
than my boyfriend.

194
00:19:46,265 --> 00:19:47,585
It's raining,
and my car is restricted today,

195
00:19:47,665 --> 00:19:49,105
and he didn't even offer
to give me a ride.

196
00:19:49,785 --> 00:19:52,065
Doesn't your boyfriend always pick you up?

197
00:19:52,145 --> 00:19:53,625
He's quite considerate.

198
00:19:53,705 --> 00:19:55,745
What's the point of having a boyfriend
if he's not considerate?

199
00:19:55,825 --> 00:19:57,985
I have to deal with a mean boss
with a weird temper

200
00:19:58,065 --> 00:19:59,665
at work already.

201
00:19:59,745 --> 00:20:01,185
Dealing with another one after work

202
00:20:01,265 --> 00:20:03,345
will make my life miserable.

203
00:20:07,545 --> 00:20:08,505
Where were you last night?

204
00:20:08,585 --> 00:20:09,865
You didn't even change your clothes.

205
00:20:13,225 --> 00:20:15,785
You're making it so obvious.

206
00:20:15,865 --> 00:20:17,585
It's not even a big deal. Just show it.

207
00:20:18,505 --> 00:20:22,265
Linda from Sales
always shows off her sexcapades.

208
00:20:25,145 --> 00:20:26,385
-Boss.
-Morning, Luke.

209
00:20:48,945 --> 00:20:51,065
Sun Yu is that good, huh?

210
00:20:51,145 --> 00:20:53,385
Was he as amazing as she said he was?

211
00:20:53,465 --> 00:20:54,785
Introduce him to me.

212
00:20:54,865 --> 00:20:56,745
-I'll gauge him for you.
-Enough…

213
00:20:56,825 --> 00:20:58,505
Stop guessing.

214
00:20:58,585 --> 00:20:59,785
My laptop is…

215
00:21:00,705 --> 00:21:01,545
What's wrong with your laptop?

216
00:21:02,945 --> 00:21:05,345
I left my laptop in Sun Yu's car.

217
00:21:06,025 --> 00:21:07,785
I need to call her
and ask her to bring it back.

218
00:21:07,865 --> 00:21:09,025
I'll go to Luke then.

219
00:21:09,105 --> 00:21:10,425
What for?

220
00:21:11,985 --> 00:21:14,585
I'll tell him
you didn't go home last night.

221
00:21:15,185 --> 00:21:17,225
Don't. What are you telling him?

222
00:21:17,305 --> 00:21:18,945
Why are you so scared?

223
00:21:19,025 --> 00:21:20,945
Are you traumatized by him or what?

224
00:21:21,025 --> 00:21:22,305
We'll be talking about the proposal.

225
00:21:22,905 --> 00:21:24,865
He couldn't care less
about the man you saw.

226
00:21:25,865 --> 00:21:29,385
Shouldn't you check with Alex
first about the proposal?

227
00:21:30,825 --> 00:21:31,665
Yikes.

228
00:21:31,745 --> 00:21:33,225
Thank you for the reminder.

229
00:21:33,305 --> 00:21:34,865
Otherwise, I would've been scolded.

230
00:21:34,945 --> 00:21:36,185
Alex comes in late.

231
00:21:36,265 --> 00:21:37,265
I'll get a cup of coffee.

232
00:21:37,345 --> 00:21:38,585
Do you want anything?

233
00:21:38,665 --> 00:21:40,665
No, thanks. Go. I'll make the call.

234
00:21:41,505 --> 00:21:42,945
Brandish it.

235
00:21:52,745 --> 00:21:53,785
Luke.

236
00:21:53,865 --> 00:21:56,225
I left my laptop bag in your car.

237
00:21:57,345 --> 00:21:58,625
<i>I'll bring it to you later.</i>

238
00:21:59,145 --> 00:21:59,985
No need.

239
00:22:00,065 --> 00:22:01,625
I'm at the parking lot.

240
00:22:01,705 --> 00:22:03,625
I'll find an empty place and wait for you.

241
00:22:15,505 --> 00:22:17,425
<i>Parking lot emergency exit.</i>

242
00:22:17,505 --> 00:22:18,665
<i>I'm there.</i>

243
00:22:18,745 --> 00:22:21,745
<i>When you come in, stomp your feet twice.</i>

244
00:22:54,545 --> 00:22:56,065
Even an arms smuggler
isn't as cautious as you.

245
00:22:59,105 --> 00:23:00,265
Thank you.

246
00:23:14,145 --> 00:23:15,185
What are you afraid of?

247
00:23:20,665 --> 00:23:21,985
I don't want people to see us.

248
00:23:22,705 --> 00:23:24,745
We must maintain a distance at work.

249
00:23:26,545 --> 00:23:28,545
And you maintain the distance
by inviting me

250
00:23:29,145 --> 00:23:30,505
to a dark staircase?

251
00:25:06,705 --> 00:25:07,625
<i>Shang Zhitao.</i>

252
00:25:09,705 --> 00:25:11,705
<i>Let's date in secret.</i>

253
00:25:20,905 --> 00:25:21,745
<i>Okay.</i>

254
00:25:31,065 --> 00:25:33,025
<i>But you can't tell anyone about us.</i>

255
00:25:37,185 --> 00:25:38,505
<i>Including your friends,</i>

256
00:25:40,105 --> 00:25:41,145
<i>your family…</i>

257
00:25:44,385 --> 00:25:45,305
<i>and your colleagues.</i>

258
00:25:48,265 --> 00:25:49,225
<i>Especially at the office.</i>

259
00:25:50,625 --> 00:25:53,065
<i>You are my superior,</i>
<i>and I am your subordinate.</i>

260
00:25:56,785 --> 00:25:57,745
<i>Fine with me.</i>

261
00:26:10,385 --> 00:26:12,345
<i>We'll remain exclusive to each other.</i>

262
00:26:13,385 --> 00:26:15,145
<i>I'll come see you every Friday.</i>

263
00:26:17,065 --> 00:26:19,185
<i>Okay. It's Friday today.</i>

264
00:26:19,265 --> 00:26:21,185
-<i>See you in a bit.</i>
-<i>See you in a bit.</i>

265
00:26:51,305 --> 00:26:52,905
THIRD FLOOR

266
00:27:10,945 --> 00:27:12,025
Hi, Mr. Luan.

267
00:27:12,105 --> 00:27:12,985
Hi, Mr. Luan.

268
